子有臣曰周舍，好直諫。周舍死，簡子毎聽朝，常不悅，大夫請罪。簡子曰：「大夫無罪。吾聞千羊之皮不如一狐之腋。諸大夫朝，徒聞唯唯，不聞周捨之鄂鄂，是以憂也。」簡子由此能附趙邑而懷晉人。"}],"rationale":"限本篇連續敘事、是為、諡稱及明示親屬語境。周舍／周捨按諫臣同段暫接；兩位周、中山武公與趙武公、子朝與趙朝分開。圍鄭晉陽知伯與較早知伯文子仍分候選，不因同爵或熟知姓名合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p031","text":"孔子聞趙簡子不請晉君而執邯鄲午，保晉陽，故書春秋曰「趙鞅以晉陽畔」。趙簡子有臣曰周舍，好直諫。周舍死，簡子毎聽朝，常不悅，大夫請罪。簡子曰：「大夫無罪。吾聞千羊之皮不如一狐之腋。諸大夫朝，徒聞唯唯，不聞周捨之鄂鄂，是以憂也。」簡子由此能附趙邑而懷晉人。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m031-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"f9x_bo2_whn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m031-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"趙簡子","kind":"person","person_id":"0xt_iyn_d3t_AAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m031-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"晉君","kind":"person","person_id":"wl7_s8c_f4l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m031-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"邯鄲午","kind":"person","person_id":"zbn_rka_hlv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m031-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"趙鞅","kind":"person","person_id":"0xt_iyn_d3t_AAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m031-0034","start":34,"end":37,"surface":"趙簡子","kind":"person","person_id":"0xt_iyn_d3t_AAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m031-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"周舍","kind":"person","person_id":"sph_y7q_7k9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m031-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"周舍","kind":"person","person_id":"sph_y7q_7k9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m031-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"簡子","kind":"person","person_id":"0xt_iyn_d3t_AAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m031-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"大夫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"